---

<div>
  <div class="section-wide py-20">
    <h2 class="h2-display">A dead end becomes a conversation.</h2>
    <p class="lede mt-4">
      Over the limit, a caller gets a token and a link to the next request. Come back, ask
      again, get a real answer.
    </p>

    <div class="mt-11 flex flex-wrap items-stretch gap-5">
      <figure class="m-0 min-w-0 flex-[1_1_440px]">
        <figcaption class="mono mb-3 text-xs text-neutral">real response · POST /api/accessgate/evaluate</figcaption>
        <pre class="code-block mono"><code><span class="tok-punc">{"{"}</span>
  <span class="tok-key">"outcome"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-amber">"Queued"</span><span class="tok-punc">,</span>
  <span class="tok-key">"callerType"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-text">"Agent"</span><span class="tok-punc">,</span>
  <span class="tok-key">"granted"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-coral">false</span><span class="tok-punc">,</span>
  <span class="tok-key">"leaseToken"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-violet">"061F6A05…70CA"</span><span class="tok-punc">,</span>
  <span class="tok-key">"reason"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-text">"rate_limit_exceeded"</span><span class="tok-punc">,</span>
  <span class="tok-hl"><span class="tok-key">"links"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-punc">{"{"}</span>
    <span class="tok-key">"poll"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-punc">{"{"}</span> <span class="tok-key">"href"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-mint">"/api/accessgate/poll"</span><span class="tok-punc">,</span> <span class="tok-key">"method"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-text">"POST"</span> <span class="tok-punc">{"}"}</span>
  <span class="tok-punc">{"}"}</span></span>
<span class="tok-punc">{"}"}</span></code></pre>
      </figure>

      <figure class="m-0 min-w-0 flex-[1_1_440px]">
        <figcaption class="mono mb-3 text-xs text-neutral">62 s later · POST /api/accessgate/poll</figcaption>
        <pre class="code-block mono"><code><span class="tok-punc">{"{"}</span>
  <span class="tok-key">"granted"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-mint">true</span><span class="tok-punc">,</span>
  <span class="tok-key">"leaseToken"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-violet">"ea530bb0…1c0c92"</span><span class="tok-punc">,</span>
  <span class="tok-key">"reason"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-text">"poll_granted_within_rate_limit"</span><span class="tok-punc">,</span>
  <span class="tok-hl"><span class="tok-key">"links"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-punc">{"{"}</span>
    <span class="tok-key">"complete"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-punc">{"{"}</span> <span class="tok-key">"href"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-mint">"/api/accessgate/complete"</span><span class="tok-punc">,</span> <span class="tok-key">"method"</span><span class="tok-punc">:</span> <span class="tok-text">"POST"</span> <span class="tok-punc">{"}"}</span>
  <span class="tok-punc">{"}"}</span></span>
<span class="tok-punc">{"}"}</span></code></pre>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-5 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6 gap-y-6 rounded-[6px] border border-rule bg-paper-2 p-6 sm:p-8">
      <div class="min-w-0 flex-[1_1_320px]">
        <div class="label">Transport</div>
        <div class="mono mt-3.5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-ink">
          <span class="pill-tag-lg">HTTP</span>
          <span class="pill-tag-lg">gRPC</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Call the gate over HTTP or gRPC — whichever your sidecar already speaks.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="min-w-0 flex-[1_1_320px]">
        <div class="label">Native SDKs</div>
        <div class="mono mt-3.5 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-[13px] font-medium text-ink">
          <span class="pill-tag-lg">JavaScript</span>
          <span class="pill-tag-lg">.NET</span>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-3.5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
          Available today for JavaScript and .NET.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
